Compatibility headers (aros/, (C) 1995-2005 The AROS Development Team)

Verbatim copies of the aros/ include directory as shipped with the
MorphOS ascii.datatype source release
(www.morphos-team.net/files/src/3.20/ascii.datatype.tar.bz2).  They
provide the AROS_*FH/LH/libcall macros that the MorphOS build of a
datatype class uses in its dispatcher; the class is compiled with -I.
so <aros/...> resolves right here, exactly like ascii.datatype does.

Do not edit these - they track the ascii.datatype release.
